    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but if everything is just a void, then doesn't that mean there's no objective difference between existing and not existing? like, if nothing matters, then the choice to stop isn't even \"bad,\" it's just a neutral decision. it almost seems more logical to just opt out when the math doesn't add up to anything positive.",
